**Factorial** — Calculate factorial (recursive & iterative)

Iterative Approach :

public class Factorial {
    public static long factorial(int n) {
        long result = 1;

        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
            result *= i;
        }

        return result;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(factorial(5));
    }
}

Recursive Approach :

public class Factorial {
    public static long factorial(int n) {

        if (n == 0 || n == 1) {
            return 1;
        }

        return n * factorial(n - 1);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(factorial(5));
    }
}
